                     QUERY PLAN                     
----------------------------------------------------
 Append
   ->  Seq Scan on coercepart_ab coercepart_1
         Filter: ((a)::text ~ ANY ('{ab}'::text[]))
   ->  Seq Scan on coercepart_bc coercepart_2
         Filter: ((a)::text ~ ANY ('{ab}'::text[]))
   ->  Seq Scan on coercepart_cd coercepart_3
         Filter: ((a)::text ~ ANY ('{ab}'::text[]))
(7 rows)

